  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 672e414a-25c7-4ab5-b6a5-3e5369d793cc
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Peak sales in November 2024 reached 118,448 units due to holiday seasonality
        • Consistent strong performance in November-December across all years
        • February 2021 showed lowest performance at 4,520 units indicating seasonal weakness

        Recommendations:
        • Focus marketing efforts on Q1 months to boost traditionally weak February performance
        • Capitalize on proven holiday season strength with enhanced November-December campaigns
